<template><div><h1 id="wiki_key_features">Key Features</h1><section><h2 id="details-setup">Open the facility and collect Exo equipment</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-outbreak-open" data-guide-step>Open routes through Administration, Holding, Morgue and Exo Testing. Use the local power generators to activate equipment as you reach it. Collect your Exo Suit from the station in Exo Testing; a suit and the Exo Slam upgrade are separate requirements.</li>
<li id="guide-step-outbreak-prepare" data-guide-step>Locate the decontamination shower before an infected round and keep a route to Administration’s four keypads open. Use the 3D Printer for the EM1 and weapon stations for upgrades; the quest later unlocks the experimental Mk 25 station.</li></ol></section>
<h1 id="wiki_main_quest">Main Quest</h1><section><h2 id="details-black-box">Authorize the Black Box</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-outbreak-box" data-guide-step>Collect the Black Box lying to the left of the crashed Warbird in spawn.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1693.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1693.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Black Box pickup beside the spawn Warbird&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Black Box pickup beside the spawn Warbird&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/outbreak_AW/outbreak_AW_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1693&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-outbreak-box-terminal" data-guide-step>Carry it to the computer on the right side of the Morgue and interact to install it. Wait for Angie’s acknowledgement before beginning the four card puzzles.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1694.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1694.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Morgue Black Box terminal&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Morgue Black Box terminal&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/outbreak_AW/outbreak_AW_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1694&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-lilith-card">Lilith’s printer card</h2><p class="guide-callout">The four named card puzzles can be completed in any order. If the named character is absent, another player can collect that card.</p><ol><li id="guide-step-outbreak-lilith-em1" data-guide-step>Obtain an EM1 from the 3D Printer. Fire its beam at the printer while purchasing another print. Collect the revealed access card; Lilith collects it when she is in the squad.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1695.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1695.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Lilith access card in the 3D Printer&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Lilith access card in the 3D Printer&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/outbreak_AW/outbreak_AW_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1695&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-decker-card">Decker’s incinerator card</h2><p class="guide-callout">The four named card puzzles can be completed in any order. If the named character is absent, another player can collect that card.</p><ol><li id="guide-step-outbreak-decker-chute" data-guide-step>Solo: buy a trash chute but back away without entering; let it close, immediately buy it again and enter. Co-op: two players buy and enter different trash chutes together. The special trip takes you to the incinerator.</li>
<li id="guide-step-outbreak-decker-floor" data-guide-step>Shoot the incinerator floor until the card pops into the air, then collect it before the room ejects you. Decker takes it if present. Repeat the special chute entry if you leave without the card; the EM1’s continuous fire can help search.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1697.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1697.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Exposed incinerator access card&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Exposed incinerator access card&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/outbreak_AW/outbreak_AW_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1697&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-oz-card">Oz’s holding-cell card</h2><p class="guide-callout">The four named card puzzles can be completed in any order. If the named character is absent, another player can collect that card.</p><ol><li id="guide-step-outbreak-oz-bar" data-guide-step>In Holding, shoot the metal bar beneath the middle cell until it disappears. Its reaction to shots identifies the correct bar.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1698.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1698.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Metal bar below the middle holding cell&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Metal bar below the middle holding cell&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/outbreak_AW/outbreak_AW_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1698&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-outbreak-oz-slam" data-guide-step>Every player buys Exo Slam. Exo-slam the top of the outermost holding cell together; one cell drops and another rises. Grab Oz’s card from the raised cell. If the cell lowers before collection, repeat the coordinated slam.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1699.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1699.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Outermost holding-cell roof used for Exo Slam&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Outermost holding-cell roof used for Exo Slam&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/outbreak_AW/outbreak_AW_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1699&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1700.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1700.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Oz card exposed by the raised cell&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Oz card exposed by the raised cell&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/outbreak_AW/outbreak_AW_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1700&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-kahn-card">Kahn’s infected-keypad card</h2><p class="guide-callout">The four named card puzzles can be completed in any order. If the named character is absent, another player can collect that card.</p><ol><li id="guide-step-outbreak-kahn-infect" data-guide-step>During an infected round, become infected in Administration. Use all four keypads during the same infection; their order is unrestricted. Cleansing before all four are used clears this attempt.<ul><li>Security-checkpoint door opposite Exo Medic.</li><li>Opposite the entrance, beside the decontamination shower.</li><li>At the far end of the red hallway, around its right corner.</li><li>Upper balcony to the left of the MP11 wallbuy.</li></ul><GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1701.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1701.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Checkpoint infection keypad&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Checkpoint infection keypad&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/outbreak_AW/outbreak_AW_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1701&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1702.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1702.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Shower-side infection keypad&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Shower-side infection keypad&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/outbreak_AW/outbreak_AW_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1702&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1703.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1703.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Red-hallway infection keypad&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Red-hallway infection keypad&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/outbreak_AW/outbreak_AW_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1703&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1704.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1704.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Upper MP11 balcony infection keypad&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Upper MP11 balcony infection keypad&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/outbreak_AW/outbreak_AW_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1704&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-outbreak-kahn-collect" data-guide-step>After all four keypads respond, return to the checkpoint window and take Kahn’s card. Let Kahn collect it if present, then cure the infection safely.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1705.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1705.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Kahn card at the opened security-checkpoint window&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Kahn card at the opened security-checkpoint window&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/outbreak_AW/outbreak_AW_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1705&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-clearance">Bring every player to clearance 49</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-outbreak-farm-cards" data-guide-step>After the four special cards, zombies begin dropping additional cards. Walk over these drops until EVERY player’s HUD badge shows 49. Count the displayed clearance rather than kills. For the optional alternate ending, apply its melee-only farming condition before this stage begins.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1706.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1706.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Zombie-dropped clearance card&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Zombie-dropped clearance card&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/outbreak_AW/outbreak_AW_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1706&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-outbreak-level-terminal" data-guide-step>Once everyone is at 49, interact with the Morgue Black Box terminal again.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-readers">Use each character’s personal reader</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-outbreak-personal-readers" data-guide-step>Each player uses the reader matching their current character. A successful scan raises that badge to 50. Recheck the character and location if the number does not rise.<ul><li>Lilith: upper Morgue room between Exo Reload and Exo Training.</li><li>Decker: halfway up the Exo Testing stairwell.</li><li>Oz: Holding, to the left of Exo Health.</li><li>Kahn: Administration, left of the Morgue doorway, opposite MP11.</li></ul><GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1707.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1707.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Lilith reader in the upper Morgue room&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Lilith reader in the upper Morgue room&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/outbreak_AW/outbreak_AW_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1707&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1708.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1708.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Decker reader on Exo Testing stairs&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Decker reader on Exo Testing stairs&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/outbreak_AW/outbreak_AW_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1708&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1709.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1709.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Oz reader beside Exo Health&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Oz reader beside Exo Health&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/outbreak_AW/outbreak_AW_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1709&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1710.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1710.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Kahn reader beside the Administration-to-Morgue doorway&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Kahn reader beside the Administration-to-Morgue doorway&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/outbreak_AW/outbreak_AW_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1710&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-extraction">Synchronize extraction</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-outbreak-reauthorize" data-guide-step>Use the Morgue computer again and wait for successful authorization. All players then interact with the Exo Suit station simultaneously.</li>
<li id="guide-step-outbreak-outro" data-guide-step>Return to spawn to see the extraction scene. The standard route allows continued play and unlocks the experimental Exo Testing upgrade station for Mk 20 → Mk 25. The qualifying alternate route ends the match.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1711.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1711.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Experimental weapon station unlocked after authorization&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Experimental weapon station unlocked after authorization&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/outbreak_AW/outbreak_AW_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1711&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<h1 id="wiki_side_quests">Side Quests</h1><section><h2 id="details-gold-ending">Optional gold statue and alternate extraction</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-outbreak-gold-conditions" data-guide-step>Choose this route before starting: nobody may go down. Complete the normal quest through the four special cards; during subsequent clearance farming, kill zombies only with melee attacks. Picking up a card from a non-melee kill invalidates the attempt.</li>
<li id="guide-step-outbreak-gold-hud" data-guide-step>The clearance number must remain light grey. Dark grey means the gold attempt is invalid and requires a new game; normal quest completion remains possible. With all players at 49 and the qualifying colour, finish the normal reader/extraction steps. This extraction ends the match and awards the gold statue visible in Descent Reception.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1696.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1696.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Light-grey badge number indicating the qualifying card route&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Light-grey badge number indicating the qualifying card route&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:229,&quot;height&quot;:259,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/outbreak_AW/outbreak_AW_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1696&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-1712.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-1712.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Dark-grey badge number after a disqualifying card&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Dark-grey badge number after a disqualifying card&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:254,&quot;height&quot;:261,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/outbreak_AW/outbreak_AW_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-1712&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-music">Ride of the Valkyries music</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-outbreak-song" data-guide-step>Interact with three tools: the wrench in the Administration wall to the right of its upgrade station; the bonesaw on a table beyond the large doors to the right of the Exo Testing chute; and the tool on the corpse table beside the Holding upgrade station. Each gives a short sound; the third starts the track.</li></ol></section><section><h2 id="guide-sources">Sources and review</h2><p>Source-reviewed on 8 October 2026, using the references below and the research handoff. These instructions and puzzle calculations have software checks; they have not been verified in a complete in-game playthrough. Record symbols, sequences and completion cues from your match. Screenshot and community-chart creators are credited with each illustration.</p><ul><li><a href="https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/AW/outbreak_AW/outbreak_AW_guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">mmmrkennedy illustrated guide ↗</a></li>
